OL,3,GNEWSAChester Marathon: Everything you
OL,4,Aneed to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 10,000 runners are expected to
OL,7,Ftake to the streets of Chester in
OL,8,FOctober for the MBNA Chester Marathon.
OL,10,FThe 26.2-mile (42.2km) race is set to
OL,11,Ffollow a route that will take in key
OL,12,FRoman sites as well as crossing the
OL,13,FEngland and Wales border.
OL,15,FThe event marks the 16th outing of the
OL,16,Fmarathon, and also includes a metric
OL,17,Fmarathon which covers a 26.2km (16.2
OL,18,Fmile) route.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
